From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SpeakerPoint firmware
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0000
Subject: [PATCH] Skip building libi2c.so; link tools against the static lib

SOCFLAGS hardcoded lowercase -fpic (GCC's "small" PIC model) for
building lib/libi2c.so. Buildroot passes "-z text" whenever building
for musl with shared libs (musl's dynamic loader crashes at runtime on
DT_TEXTREL, so this is deliberately a build-time hard error rather
than a later runtime crash - see package/Makefile.in), and the link
failed outright:

  read-only segment has dynamic relocations

Switching to -fPIC (uppercase, "large" PIC model) did not fix it
either: EP93xx/ARM920T is ARMv4t with no Thumb-2 and no MOVW/MOVT, and
plain -fPIC still can't produce a relocation-free .so for this ISA.

Nothing else on the system links against libi2c dynamically - it's
i2c-tools' own internal implementation detail - so just skip building
the shared library entirely and link the CLI tools against the static
.a instead (tools/Module.mk already supports this via USE_STATIC_LIB).
`override` is needed because Buildroot passes BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0 on
the make command line for BR2_SHARED_LIBS builds, which would
otherwise beat a plain in-Makefile assignment.

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -32,12 +32,25 @@
 # When debugging, use the following instead
 #CFLAGS		:= -O -g
 CFLAGS		+= -Wall
-SOCFLAGS	:= -fpic -D_REENTRANT $(CFLAGS)
+SOCFLAGS	:= -fPIC -D_REENTRANT $(CFLAGS)

 BUILD_DYNAMIC_LIB ?= 1
 BUILD_STATIC_LIB ?= 1
 USE_STATIC_LIB ?= 0

+# EP93xx/ARM920T (ARMv4t, no Thumb-2/MOVW-MOVT) cannot produce a
+# relocation-free libi2c.so even with -fPIC - musl's dynamic loader
+# doesn't support the resulting DT_TEXTREL, so Buildroot's musl+shared
+# libs build passes -z text and hard-fails at link time rather than
+# risk a runtime crash. Nothing else on the system links against
+# libi2c dynamically, so just skip building the .so and link the
+# tools against the static .a instead. override beats the
+# BUILD_STATIC_LIB=0 Buildroot passes on the make command line for
+# BR2_SHARED_LIBS builds.
+override BUILD_DYNAMIC_LIB := 0
+override BUILD_STATIC_LIB := 1
+override USE_STATIC_LIB := 1
+
 ifeq ($(USE_STATIC_LIB),1)
 BUILD_STATIC_LIB := 1
 endif
